iff| <= 3 days → enrich instead of append.\n\nImplementation: maintain an additional index `near: dict[(comp_key, season, pair_tuple), list[Match]]`. In `_load_match_file`, when source == \"BR-Football-Dataset.csv\" and exact key miss → search near index for candidates within ±3 days → if found, enrich the earliest and return.\n\nAlso note: the near-index should contain matches from ALL files (for lookups), keyed (comp, season, sorted_pair). Add matches there as they're appended.\n\nAlso enrich needs to update the near-index entry? It's the same object; index holds refs, fine.\n\nEdge: BR-Foot matches also vs Cup/Libertadores — same logic applies via comp key.\n\nLet me rewrite `_load_match_file` and add the near index.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_059642e8a0011UQmclkoEBueSD","sessionID":"ses_fa6ae4622ffeRIXSVkVPYYmujp","messageID":"msg_05963d7ac001nqQ5yKfv0pN1Zo"}}
