p tie... for Serie A no.\n\nAlso possible: my near-index merge for BR-Foot vs BR-Foot (same file, two rows same pair same season within 3 days) — e.g. double entries. Let me check for exact duplicates within BR-Foot itself.\n\nActually let me just test specific known truths:\n1. 2019 Brasileirão standings: Flamengo champion with 90 pts (TASK example!). Let me run league_standings(\"Brasileirão Série A\", 2019) and see. If standings look sane (each team played 38), dedupe is working.\n2. 2003 Série A: Cruzeiro champion.\n\nThis is the real acceptance test. Let me run.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05964f1a90015eyJnj4bNxhBlb","sessionID":"ses_fa6ae4622ffeRIXSVkVPYYmujp","messageID":"msg_059648f35001OmuXIry2tufGpB"}}
