{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788207104229,"sessionID":"ses_fa6ae4622ffeRIXSVkVPYYmujp","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_c17b2930db1b4e8a9a6ed34a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-7439bfc38313/brazilian_soccer_mcp/normalize.py","newString":"    key = normalize_key(base)\n\n    # 0) State-dependent overrides that beat generic aliases\n    #    (Vitória-ES is a different club from EC Vitória).\n    if key == \"vitoria\" and state == \"ES\":\n        return \"Vitória-ES\"\n    # 1) Base name resolves directly (\"Sao Paulo\", \"EC Bahia\").\n    if key in TEAM_ALIASES:\n        return TEAM_ALIASES[key]\n    # 2) Base + state qualifier resolves (\"Atletico\" + \"PR\" -> \"Athletico Paranaense\").\n    if state:\n        combo = f\"{key} {state.lower()}\"\n        if combo in TEAM_ALIASES:\n            return TEAM_ALIASES[combo]\n    # 3) Ambiguous bases must keep a geographic qualifier to stay distinct.","oldString":"    key = normalize_key(base)\n\n    # 1) Base name resolves directly (\"Sao Paulo\", \"EC Bahia\").\n    if key in TEAM_ALIASES:\n        return TEAM_ALIASES[key]\n    # 2) Base + state qualifier resolves (\"Atletico\" + \"PR\" -> \"Athletico Paranaense\").\n    if state:\n        combo = f\"{key} {state.lower()}\"\n        if combo in TEAM_ALIASES:\n            return TEAM_ALIASES[combo]\n    # 2b) State-dependent disambiguation with no alias entry.\n    if key == \"vitoria\" and state == \"ES\":\n        return \"Vitória-ES\"\n    # 3) Ambiguous bases must keep a geographic qualifier to stay distinct."},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-7439bfc38313/brazilian_soccer_mcp/normalize.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-7439bfc38313/brazilian_soccer_mcp/normalize.py\n+++ /User